# LeakSanitizer suppressions, read at the next start of a process.
# One pattern per line, matched against module, function and file:
#   leak:libfoo.so
#   leak:some_function
# Per-binary options: /etc/sanitizer/<binary>.opts (ASAN/LSAN/UBSAN flags,
# colon or newline separated; no "suppressions=" in there).
# Switch off leak checks of a running binary without a restart:
#   mkdir -p /var/run/sanitizer/off; touch /var/run/sanitizer/off/<binary>
# Leak check of all processes on demand: kill -37 <pid>   (SIGRTMIN+3)
